ong with your reading of the chart — the code you chose is a category header, not a billable code, and it is missing the characters that say which wrist, what kind of fracture, and which encounter this is."}],"$L16"]}],"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a"]}]]}],"$L1b"]}]}]]}],false,"$L1c","$undefined","$L1d","$L1e"]}]
